#. placeholder {1}: formatInt(masternodes)
#. placeholder {2}: formatInt(nodes - masternodes)
msgid "{0} reachable nodes: {1} masternodes and {2} other full nodes."
msgstr "{0} 个可达节点：{1} 个主节点和 {2} 个其他全节点。"

